/E (Key research topics: Marine Biogeochemistry, Coral Reefs, Biomineralization, Paleoclimatology, Sclerochronology, Trace Element Cycling, Stable Isotopes, Mass Spectrometry, Ocean Acidification, Carbonate Geochemistry)
/Pg 23 0 R
