/T (Where do corals go when the oceans heat up? Coral reef refugia over the Phanerozoic)
/E (Where do corals go when the oceans heat up? Coral reef refugia over the Phanerozoic)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
509 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
